              "marks": 5,
              "text": "Protect the worksheet with a password and then demonstrate how to unprotect it."
            },
            {
              "id": "excel-4",
              "marks": 5,
              "text": "Create a PivotTable from sample data, insert at least two charts based on it, and add a slicer to filter those charts."
