              "id": "excel-7",
              "marks": 5,
              "text": "Create formulas using: SUM, AVERAGE, COUNT, COUNTBLANK, MAX, MIN, LEFT, RIGHT, UPPER, LOWER, TRIM, AND, OR, SUMIF, COUNTIF, AVERAGEIF, SUMIFS, COUNTIFS, AVERAGEIFS, IF, and IFS."
            },
            {
              "id": "excel-8",
              "marks": 5,
              "text": "Convert data into a table, apply filters, and filter the top 3 values in one numeric column."
